<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78430" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-μονή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>obligation to continue in
			service</i>, of a slave whose manumission is deferred, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2863
			</span></i> (Delph.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγύους παρά τινος λαμβάνειν παραμονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHal.</u>
					1.48
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.41.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>endurance, constancy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				[2]
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>keeping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος πρὸς παραμονὴν ἐπιτήδειος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					1.30e
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλεῦκος εἰς π. χρήσιμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					6.16.3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πλείονα π. χρωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.159
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν τοῦ βρέφους παραμονήν</span>
			to make <i>room</i> for the foetus, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.125
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
